/*
 * Implements semantic validation for range construction operators in Ymir.
 *
 * Supported operators:
 *   - ..   (exclusive range)
 *   - ...  (inclusive range)
 *
 * Supported operand categories:
 *   - integers
 *   - class instances(via operator overloading)
 *
 * This module is invoked by BinaryValidation when the operator kind is
 * OperatorType::RANGE.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::binary::range
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/binary/range.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-04-09
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
